{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/869109e4385e4bbbb9fd6ec304ec1719.webp?t=1759238934\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop from asteroid to asteroid, mine resources with your laser as fast as you can, invest in upgrades, and keep moving ahead of a creeping toxic nebula. Every second counts. Do you stay a little longer for one more vein, or jump early to survive? The deeper you rush, the tighter the noose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine fast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your laser and tools to carve clever tunnels and expose rich pockets of ores. Each asteroid asks for fast route planning and clean execution to make every second pay off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile units will try to stop you while you mine. Break their assaults so you can finish the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend gathered resources on meaningful power boosts. Improve your mining speed, strengthen your kit, and tune your rover to match your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase greedy routes or play it safe and steady. Learn the rhythm of each run, refine your decisions, and push your limits for reaching further.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304080?t=1759238934","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304080?t=1759238934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/cf5e3db06cb92ddf6290f71f8a894466a56b5e12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759238934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/cf5e3db06cb92ddf6290f71f8a894466a56b5e12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759238934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/extras/869109e4385e4bbbb9fd6ec304ec1719.webp?t=1759238934\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop from asteroid to asteroid, mine resources with your laser as fast as you can, invest in upgrades, and keep moving ahead of a creeping toxic nebula. Every second counts. Do you stay a little longer for one more vein, or jump early to survive? The deeper you rush, the tighter the noose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine fast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your laser and tools to carve clever tunnels and expose rich pockets of ores. Each asteroid asks for fast route planning and clean execution to make every second pay off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile units will try to stop you while you mine. Break their assaults so you can finish the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend gathered resources on meaningful power boosts. Improve your mining speed, strengthen your kit, and tune your rover to match your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase greedy routes or play it safe and steady. Learn the rhythm of each run, refine your decisions, and push your limits for reaching further.</p>","developers":["Level Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/3b6f287f11783dd2078d4295b950e0e943552d15/header.jpg?t=1759238934","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Drillscape","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Level Labs"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304080/fc30c02d393816a6ddf5971e347e981ab887961d/ss_fc30c02d393816a6ddf5971e347e981ab887961d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759238934","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.a